  "adaptations": [
    "1.8.1 user-requested startup presentation: retain the original 4J Studios intro image at full opacity until Forge finishes, instead of transitioning to the FullScreenProgress scene. Original intro timing and fallback completion checks remain.",
    "1.8.3 user-requested startup music: start the normal selected music stream as soon as the game's audio engine is ready during the rating card. Preserve that engine through startup sound-definition refreshes. The fallback overlaps intro and initialization so audio can become ready before the rating card ends."
